<title>USA: Simms group holds 6.2 pct ThrustMaster.</title>
<headline>Simms group holds 6.2 pct ThrustMaster.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Simms Capital Management Inc said Monday it acquired a 6.2 percent stake in ThrustMaster Inc, or 254,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it paid $1.52 million for the stake in the Hillsboro, Ore.-based company.</p>
<p>It said it was holding the stake for investment purposes.</p>
</text>
